    "J": {
      "type": "npc",
      "name": "Dockmaster Quill",
      "style": "professor",
      "lines": [
        "Mind the edge, apprentice! It's a long way down to the clouds.",
        "Up here at the Skyport, nothing ever arrives the way it should. Labels are smudged, logs go missing, passengers turn up twice.",
        "A good engineer expects bad data: catch the errors before they sink the ship. Every chest on these piers will teach you something about that.",
        "Files, sets, neat formatting, clever one-line comprehensions... master the Docks and the Foundry's classes will feel like a breeze."
      ]
    },
    "K": {
      "type": "sign",
      "text": "SKYPORT DOCKS\nAirships moored to the west, middle and east piers.\nKeep to the boardwalks. The sky is not a floor."
    },
    "V": {
      "type": "npc",
      "name": "Astronomer Vega",
      "style": "foreman",
      "lines": [
        "Shh! The stars are listening. Welcome to the Celestial Observatory.",
        "Out here, the problems are too big to try every answer one by one. We halve them, we heap them, we remember them.",
        "Binary search, trees, heaps, memoization, generators and backtracking: an astronomer's toolkit.",
        "Earn enough cogs and the Grand Engine's vault, back in the Foundry, will finally open to you."
      ]
    },
    "Y": {
      "type": "sign",
      "text": "CELESTIAL OBSERVATORY\nThe Great Dome lies to the south-east. West Wing: computing hall.\nPlease do not touch the telescopes."
